# icp-cli state.
#
# ONLY the cache is disposable: it holds build artifacts and the ids of canisters on the
# throwaway local network. `.icp/data/mappings/<env>.ids.json` holds the MAINNET canister
# ids -- the replacement for canister_ids.json -- and MUST be committed.
#
# The `**/` prefix is required, not cosmetic: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to
# the directory of this .gitignore, so a bare `.icp/cache/` would silently miss every
# nested project (src/*/, llms/*/).
**/.icp/cache/
